      "releaseNotes": "iPhone Duo optimizations for a smoother Taco Bell experience.\nSave and manage PayPal or Venmo for faster checkout.\nClearer progress tracking toward free delivery and savings.\nFind your nearest Taco Bell faster with improved map zoom.\nPlus, easier Favorites management and plenty of bug fixes.",
