      "description": "Order ahead, earn points toward Taco Bell Rewards, and customize every craving, right from your phone.\n\nMeet the new Taco Bell® app, the fastest way to get what you want, exactly how you want it. Order ahead for pickup or delivery, earn points toward rewards, unlock app exclusives and make every order your own with easy customization and personalized picks.\n\nWhether it's a spontaneous new craving or your go-to order on repeat, the app makes it easier to get in, get food, and get rewarded.\n\nOrder Ahead\n・Skip the line and order in just a few taps \n・Get delivery with no added upcharge with the same prices you pay in-store\n・Order ahead for pickup in the drive-thru or in-store \n・Pay in-app for a quicker checkout experience\n\nEarn Points Toward Free Rewards \n・Every qualifying order moves you closer to the rewards you actually want, like points for free food, exclusive experiences, and merch \n・New around here? Join Taco Bell Rewards and choose your free welcome reward*\n\nCustomize Your Faves with My Mods \n・Save your ingredient preferences so customizing is easier every time \n・Apply your mods in a few taps when ordering your favorite items\n\nEnter for Access to App‑Only Exclusives + Tuesday Drops\n・Claim exclusive offers that you won't find anywhere else \n・Grab weekly Tuesday Drops for fan-favorite offers\n\nReorder Fast\n・Save favorites to make reordering simple\n・Repeat past orders in just a few taps\n\nDownload the Taco Bell® app today to order ahead, earn points toward rewards, unlock app-only exclusives, and customize every craving.\n\n*Taco Bell Rewards program is available at participating US locations and subject to terms and conditions. Points are earned on qualifying purchases. Welcome Reward valid for 14 days from issuance and redeemable once for Reward Members only via the app at participating U.S. Taco Bell® locations, while supplies last. Limit 1 per registered user. Must make selections from predetermined menu items. Terms apply.\n\n*During Happier Hour®, get $1 medium fountain drinks and regular freezes 2pm-5pm daily. At participating U.S. Taco Bell® locations. Contact restaurant for prices, hours & participation, which vary. While supplies last. Tax extra.",
